WEBVTT

00:00:02.200 --> 00:00:02.760
We'll be right back.

00:01:38.540 --> 00:01:42.940
Robots will evolve, and one day, they will rule humans.

00:01:42.940 --> 00:01:50.730
At that time, you need a king to rule the top of all robots.

00:01:50.730 --> 00:01:55.960
Atom, try to overcome the final trial I give you.

00:01:55.960 --> 00:02:00.000
If you can do it...

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:06.760
Kim is not qualified to be the king of robots.

00:02:34.090 --> 00:02:34.580
News.

00:03:06.940 --> 00:03:08.670
I'll stop you no matter what.

00:03:08.670 --> 00:03:10.570
Try shooting again.

00:03:10.570 --> 00:03:12.270
What?

00:03:12.270 --> 00:03:15.670
Oh! This is an unexpected development!

00:03:15.670 --> 00:03:16.360
There!

00:04:00.160 --> 00:04:07.650
Delta, the world champion Herakles, the robot environment observer Epsilon, and Arthur.

00:04:07.650 --> 00:04:16.130
Please look forward to the four of them.

00:04:16.130 --> 00:04:18.300
Onii-chan, are you going to take the challenge?

00:04:18.300 --> 00:04:19.400
No way.

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:24.520
I'm going!

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:31.920
The battle plan has been stopped!

00:04:31.920 --> 00:04:37.580
Someone has interfered with our combat training.

00:04:37.580 --> 00:04:41.530
All right, I'll go first.

00:04:41.530 --> 00:04:45.320
Come on!

00:04:45.320 --> 00:04:51.990
Delta, you seem to be able to use the best survival tactics on earth, but it won't work on me.

00:04:51.990 --> 00:04:55.670
Pluto, how about that?

00:05:03.130 --> 00:05:14.830
I don't know where I'm supposed to be, so I'm going to shoot you!

00:05:14.830 --> 00:05:19.110
There!

00:05:19.110 --> 00:05:21.380
What?

00:05:31.370 --> 00:05:36.840
That's because I'm the strongest in the survival battle.

00:05:36.840 --> 00:05:43.250
And?

00:05:43.250 --> 00:05:45.730
What do you mean, a robot that evolves?

00:05:45.730 --> 00:05:51.360
Sire, this gauge probably indicates that Pluto's fighting ability has increased.

00:05:51.360 --> 00:05:55.040
Does Pluto learn the opponent's ability and evolve?

00:05:55.040 --> 00:05:56.950
But what's the purpose?

00:05:56.950 --> 00:06:00.000
If the masked man is Dr. Tenma, he will be able to defeat Atom.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:02.690
I'm sure he's going to seek revenge on the Ministry of Science.

00:06:02.690 --> 00:06:05.590
Professor, before his ability becomes the best,

00:06:05.590 --> 00:06:07.010
why don't you hit Atom?

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:10.680
I won't let you do such a thing!

00:06:10.680 --> 00:06:14.090
Pluto will win over the remaining three robots,

00:06:14.090 --> 00:06:18.630
and rule the world as the strongest robot on earth!

00:06:18.630 --> 00:06:21.800
Hey, will Atom lose to Pluto, too?

00:06:21.800 --> 00:06:22.620
Hmm?

00:06:22.620 --> 00:06:23.970
No way!

00:06:23.970 --> 00:06:27.450
But I'm looking forward to seeing which robot is the strongest.

00:06:27.450 --> 00:06:28.490
Hmm.

00:06:28.490 --> 00:06:30.000
This is Athenemia.

00:06:31.240 --> 00:06:36.240
We are here to announce the battle of the world's best robot, Hercules.

00:06:36.240 --> 00:06:41.230
Hercules is challenging the battle with great spirit after receiving the announcement of the war of the Fruits.

00:06:41.230 --> 00:06:42.150
Hercules!

00:06:42.150 --> 00:06:43.090
I've decided!

00:06:43.090 --> 00:06:47.890
Fruits!

00:06:47.890 --> 00:06:50.990
You are not an enemy of Hercules!

00:06:50.990 --> 00:07:00.000
The robot environment observer Epsilon is trying to predict the appearance of a giant tornado by its high-level electromagnetic intelligence.

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:15.040
I predicted that if this is true, there will be serious damage to the nearby town, but as you can see, Tatsumaki, or even Tsumujikaze

00:07:30.670 --> 00:07:46.200
That's right! Tatsumaki has been completely destroyed by Epsilon!

00:07:46.200 --> 00:07:54.830
What's the chance that Atom will defeat Pluton?

00:07:54.830 --> 00:07:56.680
Do you have any plans?

00:07:56.680 --> 00:07:58.680
Atom can't fight!

00:07:58.680 --> 00:08:00.000
Are you afraid of Pluton?

00:08:02.680 --> 00:08:05.910
I'm not going to run away, onii-chan!

00:08:05.910 --> 00:08:08.750
Onii-chan!

00:08:08.750 --> 00:08:09.810
Brutal...

00:08:09.810 --> 00:08:11.860
Why did you do this to the innocent robots?

00:08:14.850 --> 00:08:16.860
It's too late now.

00:08:16.860 --> 00:08:18.390
Huh?

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:21.260
Huh?

00:08:21.260 --> 00:08:21.920
Huh?

00:08:31.440 --> 00:08:36.280
Dr. Tenma, it's ridiculous that robots compete with each other in strength!

00:08:36.280 --> 00:08:38.860
You should stop it immediately!

00:08:38.860 --> 00:08:41.250
Unfortunately, I can't do that.

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:42.310
What?

00:08:42.310 --> 00:08:45.610
Atom will fight Pluto.

00:08:45.610 --> 00:08:48.110
Then Atom will evolve.

00:08:48.110 --> 00:08:51.950
The ultimate evolution that humans can't even imagine.

00:08:51.950 --> 00:08:55.230
Huh? Ev-Evolution?

00:08:55.230 --> 00:08:58.360
What the hell are you thinking?

00:09:01.530 --> 00:09:04.390
Grrr... Dr. Tenma!

00:09:04.390 --> 00:09:09.990
The ultimate evolution is the real reason for the birth of the Atoms.

00:09:09.990 --> 00:09:19.780
What are they looking at?

00:09:19.780 --> 00:09:23.080
They're waiting for me to fight Brutal.

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:24.550
That's the worst!

00:09:24.550 --> 00:09:26.370
I can't go on a date with them.

00:09:26.370 --> 00:09:27.940
A-A date?

00:09:27.940 --> 00:09:30.000
I want to go on a date with the birds of the forest...

00:09:30.120 --> 00:09:32.180
We're going to play in the garden every morning.

00:09:32.180 --> 00:09:34.530
I'm looking forward to it, Uran.

00:09:34.530 --> 00:09:35.750
I see.

00:09:38.710 --> 00:09:41.700
Well, well.

00:09:41.700 --> 00:09:44.600
It's a pain in the ass to go back to your own house.

00:09:44.600 --> 00:09:45.780
Thank you for your hard work.

00:09:45.780 --> 00:09:47.320
What's wrong?

00:09:47.320 --> 00:09:48.880
You're all wet.

00:09:48.880 --> 00:09:50.390
Oh, it's nothing.

00:09:50.390 --> 00:09:51.250
Doctor.

00:09:51.250 --> 00:09:51.920
Huh?

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:54.850
I'm going to fight Pluto.

00:09:54.850 --> 00:09:55.700
No!

00:09:55.700 --> 00:09:58.000
Why?

00:09:58.000 --> 00:10:00.000
You're going to hurt a robot with no sin.

00:10:00.350 --> 00:10:02.000
Pluton won't forgive me!

00:10:02.000 --> 00:10:03.350
So I'll...

00:10:03.350 --> 00:10:05.350
You can't do anything wrong!

00:10:05.350 --> 00:10:10.280
Professor must be worried.

00:10:10.280 --> 00:10:13.510
If Onii-chan loses to Pluton...

00:10:13.510 --> 00:10:15.390
I won't lose!

00:10:15.390 --> 00:10:16.640
That's enough!

00:10:16.640 --> 00:10:21.160
I'm sad that the robots are fighting each other.

00:10:21.160 --> 00:10:24.870
Certainly, I won't forgive what Pluton is doing.

00:10:24.870 --> 00:10:28.210
But the bad thing is not the robots.

00:10:28.210 --> 00:10:30.000
It's Tenma, who organized this fight.

00:10:30.000 --> 00:10:39.440
Professor!

00:10:39.440 --> 00:10:42.400
You really are a wonderful robot.

00:10:42.400 --> 00:10:44.400
Use that power for my sake.

00:10:44.400 --> 00:10:45.250
Tomio!

00:10:45.250 --> 00:10:53.450
My power is not yours.

00:10:53.450 --> 00:10:57.920
I win again today!

00:10:57.920 --> 00:10:58.740
Pluto...

00:10:58.740 --> 00:10:59.690
Where are you?

00:10:59.690 --> 00:11:00.000
I...

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:01.160
Let's have a match!

00:11:01.160 --> 00:11:03.660
Prut, you've got to be kidding me.

00:11:03.660 --> 00:11:05.500
I'm out of breath!

00:11:05.500 --> 00:11:10.590
I've kept you waiting for a long time, haven't I?

00:11:10.590 --> 00:11:14.300
I'm going to give you a lot of Hurley's army back!

00:11:14.300 --> 00:11:19.040
Prut!

00:11:19.040 --> 00:11:21.080
I'm going to attack the robot destroyer!

00:11:21.080 --> 00:11:25.590
Get out of my way!

00:11:25.590 --> 00:11:27.190
I'm going to take him down!

00:11:27.190 --> 00:11:30.000
Proud warrior Herakles.

00:11:30.670 --> 00:11:34.170
Looks like there are no lies in that name.

00:11:34.170 --> 00:11:45.810
I wonder if I should try it?

00:11:45.810 --> 00:11:47.190
That's right.

00:11:47.190 --> 00:11:50.920
Huh?

00:11:50.920 --> 00:11:53.680
Is Herakles fighting now?

00:11:53.680 --> 00:11:56.870
He's going to Athenania.

00:11:56.870 --> 00:11:58.680
Are you going to fight?

00:11:58.680 --> 00:12:00.000
No, I'm going to talk to him.

00:12:07.930 --> 00:12:08.610
Where are you going?

00:12:08.610 --> 00:12:23.780
I'm not giving up!

00:12:23.780 --> 00:12:27.240
I will never give up!

00:12:34.510 --> 00:12:44.280
Now!

00:12:44.280 --> 00:12:47.420
You've made up your mind, haven't you?

00:12:47.420 --> 00:12:49.670
3 seconds to destroy the sword and shield.

00:12:49.670 --> 00:12:52.250
11 seconds to end everything.

00:12:52.250 --> 00:12:53.270
What?!

00:13:02.250 --> 00:13:07.890
You won't win if you lose your sword and shield.

00:13:07.890 --> 00:13:08.960
Give it up.

00:13:11.470 --> 00:13:14.170
I won't die!

00:13:19.720 --> 00:13:24.580
I am Herakles.

00:13:24.580 --> 00:13:26.240
I am proud of myself!

00:13:32.200 --> 00:13:35.340
Three of them.

00:13:35.340 --> 00:13:53.240
It's a match, Atom!

00:14:01.690 --> 00:14:03.360
Don't do it.

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:05.690
Why are you fighting?

00:14:05.690 --> 00:14:08.720
To win.

00:14:08.720 --> 00:14:13.890
No way!

00:14:33.710 --> 00:14:35.670
I'll be fine for a while.

00:14:35.670 --> 00:14:37.320
Why?

00:14:37.320 --> 00:14:39.500
I'm an enemy.

00:14:39.500 --> 00:14:40.700
Enemy?

00:14:40.700 --> 00:14:44.800
Robots are made as human friends.

00:14:44.800 --> 00:14:48.280
It's absolutely impossible for those robots to fight each other.

00:14:48.280 --> 00:14:51.950
I was made just to fight.

00:14:51.950 --> 00:14:53.460
Friends?

00:15:00.830 --> 00:15:02.500
Don't move yet!

00:15:02.500 --> 00:15:07.040
I will settle this with you one day.

00:15:07.040 --> 00:15:08.510
See you again!

00:15:12.590 --> 00:15:14.910
Brute...

00:15:14.910 --> 00:15:22.370
Doctor, what is a friend?

00:15:22.370 --> 00:15:26.840
It has nothing to do with your combat program.

00:15:26.840 --> 00:15:30.000
Your combat numbers are lower than expected.

00:15:30.700 --> 00:15:34.170
Is the cause of the contact with Atom?

00:15:34.170 --> 00:15:40.640
Pluto, you are a robot that was made only to become stronger in battle.

00:15:40.640 --> 00:15:46.860
You should rest a little in preparation for the next battle.

00:15:46.860 --> 00:15:52.360
Dutch...

00:15:52.360 --> 00:15:56.860
Defeating even Aqualus... Pluto is really a terrifying robot.

00:15:56.860 --> 00:15:59.860
But Doctor, Pluto also has a heart!

00:16:00.440 --> 00:16:02.040
The same heart as mine!

00:16:02.040 --> 00:16:08.710
But, more than that heart, Prut is loyal to Dr. Tenma's orders.

00:16:08.710 --> 00:16:19.560
I'm tired.

00:16:19.560 --> 00:16:23.040
Over here, over here.

00:16:23.040 --> 00:16:25.260
Hmm, is this place okay?

00:16:25.260 --> 00:16:26.260
Eheheh!

00:16:26.260 --> 00:16:27.840
Wow!

00:16:31.720 --> 00:16:37.600
It's been a long time.

00:16:37.600 --> 00:16:41.650
You came to see me.

00:16:41.650 --> 00:16:46.640
I said I was waiting for you.

00:16:46.640 --> 00:16:49.370
That's right.

00:16:49.370 --> 00:16:57.010
You said you were waiting for me.

00:17:33.610 --> 00:18:00.000
I'm going to the Atom's house.

00:18:00.000 --> 00:18:03.450
It's your little sister, right? What was that just now?

00:18:03.450 --> 00:18:06.380
Huh? It's a song!

00:18:06.380 --> 00:18:10.240
A song? That's a very strange feeling.

00:18:10.240 --> 00:18:17.850
Can you do it again?

00:18:17.850 --> 00:18:21.060
No. There's something I really want to ask Atom.

00:18:58.000 --> 00:19:00.000
What do you want from me?

00:19:00.860 --> 00:19:04.210
Don't make such a scary face, Captain.

00:19:04.210 --> 00:19:06.730
You're going to ruin the video.

00:19:06.730 --> 00:19:07.630
Hey!

00:19:07.630 --> 00:19:09.430
You're waiting for the camera, aren't you?

00:19:09.430 --> 00:19:11.590
Shoot perfectly, perfectly!

00:19:11.590 --> 00:19:14.250
I'm going to destroy the Robocraft!

00:19:14.250 --> 00:19:16.730
I'm Ham X!

00:19:16.730 --> 00:19:30.000
Fight the strongest warriors I've prepared in front of Atom!

00:19:37.550 --> 00:19:41.260
There is no point in fighting such a scum.

00:19:41.260 --> 00:19:43.780
Unfortunately, it's here.

00:19:43.780 --> 00:19:52.950
Rokusen no machi, go!

00:20:04.120 --> 00:20:06.540
Only 10 seconds left.

00:20:06.540 --> 00:20:19.200
It's a monster!

00:20:46.830 --> 00:20:47.830
Are you alright?

00:21:01.820 --> 00:21:03.160
N-No, it's not like that!

00:21:05.250 --> 00:21:14.840
O-Orii-chan!

00:21:14.840 --> 00:21:19.560
I won't forgive you!

00:21:19.560 --> 00:21:26.690
With me...

00:21:35.530 --> 00:21:40.140
Even though his fighting skills are incomplete, he has made quite a lot of progress.

00:21:40.140 --> 00:21:43.990
What will happen after this match?

00:22:12.700 --> 00:22:23.070
Why do my tears fall when I open my heart?

00:22:23.070 --> 00:22:30.000
Why, why do my tears fall?

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:53.910
When I run, I become alone. I put my little knee on it and look up at the sky again.

00:23:01.020 --> 00:23:26.920
High, high, that's a kind robot!

00:23:32.400 --> 00:23:35.890
Next time: "Fruit doesn't die! With my heart!"
